close_reason: "The tracker measurement ratchet now measures a commit view — the exact file set the next commit would carry, built from git ls-files --cached --others --exclude-standard, with no .git — so its verdict is a property of the commit rather than of whoever's machine ran it. The two environment facts that split the verdict are neutralized at the source: gitignored installed packages under .agents/pm/extensions are absent from the view in every environment, and clone-local merge-driver git config is unreadable there, so pm health integrity stops flipping on it. A maintainer checkout and a fresh clone of the same commit now report identical populations for all 19 declared selectors."
body: ""
